---
title: Sequence Diagram — Loan Flow (Functions vs Commit-Reveal · Authority Brief)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Borrower
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant ML as FastAPI ML
    participant DON as Chainlink Functions DON
    participant SC as LocalBank Contract
    participant APV as Approver Dashboard
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>FE: Submit loan request (USDC amount, term)
    FE->>API: POST /loans { signed EIP-712 }
    API->>DB: INSERT loan_request (PENDING)
    API->>SC: applyLoan(borrower, amount_usdc)
    SC-->>API: emit LoanApplied

    alt Primary — Chainlink Functions
        API->>ML: POST /score { borrower features }
        ML->>ML: RF + iForest + stacking + SHAP
        ML->>DON: HTTPS score payload
        DON->>DON: Multi-node consensus
        DON->>SC: commitRiskScore(requestId, score)
        SC-->>API: emit RiskScoreCommitted
    else Fallback — commit-reveal relay
        ML-->>API: { score, shap, model_version }
        API->>DB: INSERT ai_ml_log (hash commit)
        Note over API,SC: Phase I–II: reveal at approval
    end

    API->>APV: Authority Brief UI<br/>(SHAP · tier · agent rec)
    APV->>APV: Review ML score + SHAP breakdown

    alt Approver approves
        APV->>API: POST /loans/{id}/approve
        API->>SC: approveLoan + revealScore verify
        SC->>SC: SCORE_REVEALED gate
        SC-->>API: emit LoanApproved
        API->>DB: UPDATE loan SET status=ACTIVE
        API-->>U: Loan approved · USDC disbursed
    else Approver rejects
        APV->>API: POST /loans/{id}/reject
        API->>SC: rejectLoan(requestId, reason)
        SC-->>API: emit LoanRejected
        API->>DB: UPDATE loan SET status=REJECTED
        API-->>U: Loan rejected — see reason
    end
